            #L5RPW70rA4xM5wR7oG7bQ3pT5tN: shinobi_wasps_spite "Wasp's Spite Style: When performing a Martial Arts [Ranged] check, may spend Air/Void (op)(op): If they did not succeed, choose another target at range 0-2 of their target with vigilance lower than or equal to target's. New target suffers physical damage equal to weapon's base damage."
